OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudy, and patches of light rain will
OL,7,Fpush up from the south during the
OL,8,Fevening. The odd shower, overnight.
OL,9,FFeeling chilly, though winds will ease
OL,10,Fslightly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy, with occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy or thundery showers mainly
OL,14,Fduring the morning and focused around
OL,15,Fthe south coast. Drier and brighter
OL,16,Faway from here, but feeling chilly
OL,17,Facross the region.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
