OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FVariable cloud and fog patches at
OL,7,Ffirst on Saturday, with isolated
OL,8,Fshowers. Becoming increasingly clear
OL,9,Fand dry through to Monday with
OL,10,Fpleasant sunshine, and colder nights
OL,11,Fbringing frost and fog.
